WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.569
Supporting Charlotte Mason families in a public charter school

1
00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:06.880
brings incredible literature rich learning into the home,

2
00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.689
but it can also create some challenges.

3
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:12.689
This Charlotte Mason approach relies heavily on

4
00:00:12.689 --> 00:00:14.850
oral narration in the early grades,

5
00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:18.110
delaying the introduction of formal written composition

6
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.950
until around age 9.

7
00:00:20.329 --> 00:00:24.450
This makes capturing traditional paper and pencil work samples challenging.

8
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.829
Many classic Charlotte Mason book lists are deeply faith-based,

9
00:00:29.069 --> 00:00:31.989
and any non-secular literature on these lists

10
00:00:31.989 --> 00:00:34.740
cannot currently be purchased with student funds.

11
00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:38.069
The gentle spiral progression of Charlotte Mason

12
00:00:38.229 --> 00:00:41.229
doesn't always align with grade-level state standards

13
00:00:41.229 --> 00:00:43.209
or the timing of benchmark testing.

14
00:00:43.529 --> 00:00:43.540
Because

15
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.959
families rarely use a single boxed curriculum,

16
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:51.569
sourcing dozens of individual living books to create a broad feast

17
00:00:51.569 --> 00:00:55.889
can create purchasing delays and planning complexity for parents and teachers.